menu "ESP32-P4 ES8311 platform audio"
    config PLATFORM_AUDIO_ES8311_ELECROW_10_1_BUILD_ONLY
        bool "Compile the reviewed Elecrow 10.1-inch ES8311 path"
        default n
        help
            Compiles only the expected ES8311-to-NS4263B speaker path. This is
            a build gate, not permission to flash or drive GPIO30 low. Runtime
            remains blocked until connected-unit population/continuity proves
            the optional NS4168 outputs are absent or isolated and address
            0x18 is observed on the shared control bus.

    config PLATFORM_AUDIO_ES8311_WAVESHARE_4_3_BUILD_ONLY
        bool "Compile the Waveshare 4.3-inch ES8311 path"
        default n
        help
            Enables the Waveshare I2S GPIO13/12/10/9 path and active-high
            GPIO53 amplifier control. This is a build-only gate; codec
            presence, speaker wiring, and acoustic output remain unverified.
endmenu
